    "chunk_text": "XIII KALENDAS FEBRUARII. PASSIO SANCTI SEBASTIANI MARTYRIS. SEBASTIANUS HATTE SUM HALIG GODES \u00f0EGN se w\u00e6s lange on lare on Mediolana byrig, and He w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e snotor wer and so\u00f0f\u00e6st on spr\u00e6ce, rihtwis on dome and on r\u00e6de foregleaw, getreowe on D\u00e6ghwamlice he gefylde his drihtnes \u00feenunge geornlice, ac he bediglode swa \u00feeah his d\u00e6da \u00feam casere He lufode swa \u00feeah \u00f0one halgan w\u00e6r, nyste \u00fe\u00e6t he gelyfde on \u00feone lifigendan God. He gesette hine to ealdre ofer an werod, and het hine symble beon \u00e6tforan his gesih\u00f0e. And ealle \u00fea hyredmenn hine h\u00e6fdon for f\u00e6der and mid lufe wur\u00f0odon, for\u00f0on \u00fee God hine lufode. He folgode \u00feam kasere uncu\u00f0 him swa \u00feeah, na swylce he ne dorste for his drihtne \u00f0rowian, ac he \u00dea geseah Sebastianus hu sume \u00fea Cristenan woldon awacian for \u00f0am orm\u00e6tum witum, and gehyrte \u00dea w\u00e6ron twegen gebro\u00f0ra \u00e6\u00feelborene for worulde, Marcus and Marcellianus, mycclum geswencte on Hi sceoldon \u00fea underhnigan nacodum swurde, ac heora frynd ab\u00e6don fyrst \u00e6t \u00feam gerefan \u00f0rittigra \u00dea bet\u00e6hte Chromatius se heahgerefa \u00fea cnihtas sumum \u00feegne to gehealdenne se hatte Nicostratus. Tranquillinus hatte \u00feyssera halgena f\u00e6der, and heora modor w\u00e6s Martia gecyged, h\u00e6\u00f0ena \u00fea gyt, and \u00de\u00e6",
